--- Fix nightly integrity check to monitor BOTH directions ---

Location: app.py @ L3506-3510 (nightly integrity check)

CURRENT CODE (only monitors warehouse > ledger):
```python
cur.execute("""
    SELECT count(*) FROM pcb_inventory."tblWhse_Inventory" w JOIN net n
      ON w.pcn::text=n.pcn AND lower(translate(coalesce(w.mpn,''),'-# ./',''))=n.mpn_key
    WHERE w.onhandqty > n.qty
""")
stored_above_ledger = cur.fetchone()[0]
```

FIXED CODE (monitors BOTH directions):
```python
# Check warehouse > ledger (phantom stock - Bug #10 regression)
cur.execute("""
    SELECT count(*) FROM pcb_inventory."tblWhse_Inventory" w JOIN net n
      ON w.pcn::text=n.pcn AND lower(translate(coalesce(w.mpn,''),'-# ./',''))=n.mpn_key
    WHERE w.onhandqty > n.qty
""")
stored_above_ledger = cur.fetchone()[0]

# Check warehouse < ledger (missing stock - NEW monitoring)
cur.execute("""
    SELECT count(*) FROM pcb_inventory."tblWhse_Inventory" w JOIN net n
      ON w.pcn::text=n.pcn AND lower(translate(coalesce(w.mpn,''),'-# ./',''))=n.mpn_key
    WHERE w.onhandqty < n.qty AND ABS(w.onhandqty - n.qty) > 5
""")
stored_below_ledger = cur.fetchone()[0]
```

UPDATE tblIntegrityCheckLog table schema:
```python
cur.execute("""
    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS pcb_inventory."tblIntegrityCheckLog" (
        id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
        checked_at timestamptz DEFAULT NOW(),
        double_count integer,
        negative_onhand integer,
        pcn_collision integer,
        stored_above_ledger integer,
        stored_below_ledger integer  -- NEW column
    )
""")
```

UPDATE insert statement:
```python
cur.execute("""INSERT INTO pcb_inventory."tblIntegrityCheckLog"
               (double_count,negative_onhand,pcn_collision,stored_above_ledger,stored_below_ledger)
               VALUES (%s,%s,%s,%s,%s)""",
            (double_count, negative_onhand, pcn_collision, stored_above_ledger, stored_below_ledger))
```

UPDATE warning condition:
```python
if double_count or negative_onhand or pcn_collision or stored_above_ledger or stored_below_ledger:
    logger.warning(
        "INTEGRITY CHECK regression: double_count=%s negatives=%s "
        "collisions=%s above_ledger=%s below_ledger=%s",
        double_count, negative_onhand, pcn_collision, stored_above_ledger, stored_below_ledger)
```

--- End of patch ---

This adds monitoring for warehouse < ledger (missing stock) in addition to
warehouse > ledger (phantom stock), giving full visibility into discrepancies.
